                                                "sense_id": "9d297bb7-86ad-3377-9b5f-d5b01fef60f2",
                                                "text": "Please arrange these numbers in an ascending order."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7af05be-7a42-4db8-8ff0-387a3249d1b1",
                                                "sense_id": "9d297bb7-86ad-3377-9b5f-d5b01fef60f2",
                                                "text": "Once though the station the deep-throated exhaust of G.C.R. engines, and particularly the \"Directors\", could be heard in ascending crescendo as the drivers opened out to take the gradient."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
