                                        "entry_id": "6e2ca315-f0df-3d8e-a30e-8ec475ff6159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rising or increasing to higher levels, values, or degrees. (e.g. of a sequence)",
                                            "That causes a sequence to follow an ascending order."
